cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "TESS NG Car-Following Model Benchmark Dataset"
abstract: >-
  Trajectory dataset from a TESS NG microsimulation study benchmarking the four
  built-in car-following models (IDM, OVM, Wiedemann 74, Wiedemann 99) at
  default parameters across a controlled work-zone bottleneck. Contains 51 valid
  simulation runs (64 nominal), each exporting per-vehicle trajectories at ~30 Hz
  over 600 s from a 3-lane, 300 m work-zone scenario.
